    # "A couple of guards approached me."
    "Un par de guardias se me acercaron."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:279
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_c42faefa:

    # "The bulkier of the guards addressed me:"
    "El más corpulento de los guardias se dirigió a mí:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:286
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_e90f2e18:

    # GUARD "Hey you!"
    GUARD "¡Eh, tú!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:283
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_6a6fece0:

    # MC "Sir-yes-sir?"
    MC "¿Señor, sí, señor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:288
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_db8427af:

    # GUARD "You are! Aren't!"
    GUARD "¡Tú! ¡¿A dónde Vas?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:285
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_1a98a6f6:

    # "As he waved his halberd at me, another guard interjected in a way friendlier tone:"
    "Mientras agitaba su alabarda hacia mí, otro guardia intervino en un tono mucho más amistoso:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:290
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_cad8e349:

    # SECOND_GUARD "Do you see the sun up in the sky, recruit?"
    SECOND_GUARD "¿Ves el sol en el cielo, recluta?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:288
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_b5178cbc:

    # "Seeing exactly what was coming next, I nodded without even looking up:"
    "Viendo exactamente lo que venía a continuación, asentí sin siquiera levantar la vista:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:289
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtSkippingTraining_f34203aa:

    # MC "Yeah."
    MC "Sí."

